      "text": "🚨 TRAFFIC ADVISORY — PBEL CITY WINTER HALF 2025 🚨\n\n📅 Date: 07 December 2025\n⏰ Time: 05:00 AM – 09:00 AM\n🏃 Event: PBEL City Hyderabad Winter Half 2025 (32K, 21K, 10K, 5K, 2K Run)\nTo facilitate the marathon event, traffic restrictions will be in place along the following route:\n\n➡️ PBEL City → TGPA Rotary → ORR Service Road → Manchirevula → ORR Service Road → TGPA Rotary → PBEL City\n\n⚠️ Public Advisory:\n• Expect slow movement and diversions on the above stretches\n• Avoid the route during event hours\n• Use alternate routes to prevent delays\n• Follow instructions of Traffic Police and event volunteers\n\n Cyberabad Traffic Police will be managing traffic to ensure smooth conduct of the event.\n\n#trafficalert #pbelcityrun #winterhalf2025 #cyberabadtrafficpolice #roadsafety #eventtraffic",
